          <li>
            <strong class="text-stone-950 dark:text-stone-50">Travel and Leisure:</strong> We have built highways and airports faster than good places to stay. India has about 1.8 lakh branded hotel rooms across the whole country, less than many single cities in Asia. Clean, mid-priced stays near big cities are hard to find.
